#: lms/djangoapps/lms_xblock/mixin.py:70
msgid ""
"Enter the chrome, or navigation tools, to use for the XBlock in the LMS. Valid values are: \n"
"\"chromeless\" -- to not use tabs or the accordion; \n"
"\"tabs\" -- to use tabs only; \n"
"\"accordion\" -- to use the accordion only; or \n"
"\"tabs,accordion\" -- to use tabs and the accordion."
msgstr ""
"Indtast det udseende, eller de navigationsværktøjer, der skal bruges til XBlock i LMS. Gyldige værdier er: \n"
"\"chromeless\" -- for ikke at bruge faner eller akkordeon; \n"
"\"tabs\" -- for kun at bruge faner; \n"
"\"accordion\" -- for kun at bruge akkordeonen; eller \n"
"\"tabs,accordion\" -- for at bruge både faner og akkordeon."

