#: lms/templates/static_pdfbook.html:20 lms/templates/staticbook.html:79
msgid "Content"
msgstr "Indhold"

#: cms/templates/course_info.html:47
msgid "New Update"
msgstr "Ny opdatering"

#: cms/templates/course_info.html:57
msgid ""
"Use course updates to notify students of important dates or exams, highlight"
" particular discussions in the forums, announce schedule changes, and "
"respond to student questions. You add or edit updates in HTML."
msgstr ""
"Brug kursusopdateringer til at informere deltagere om vigtige datoer eller "
"eksamener, fremhæve bestemte diskussioner i foraene, annoncere ændringer i "
"tidsplanen og besvare spørgsmål fra deltagere. Du tilføjer eller redigerer "
"opdateringer i HTML."

