"processens start, medtages i en efterfølgende rapport. Rapporten genereres "
"flere gange om dagen."

#: lms/templates/instructor/instructor_dashboard_2/data_download_2.html:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{strong_start}Note{strong_end}: {ul_start}{li_start}To keep student data "
"secure, you cannot save or         email these links for direct access. "
"Copies of links expire within 5 minutes.{li_end}{li_start}Report files"
"         are deleted 90 days after generation. If you will need access to "
"old reports, download and store the files,         in accordance with your "
"institution's data security policies.{li_end}{ul_end}"
msgstr ""
"{strong_start}Bemærk{strong_end}: {ul_start}{li_start}For at beskytte "
"kursisternes data kan du ikke gemme eller sende disse links via e-mail til "
"direkte adgang. Kopier af links udløber efter 5 "
"minutter.{li_end}{li_start}Rapportfiler slettes 90 dage efter genereringen. "
"Hvis du får brug for adgang til gamle rapporter, skal du downloade og gemme "
"filerne i overensstemmelse med din institutions "
"datasikkerhedspolitikker.{li_end}{ul_end}"

